-> RED\n GW --> MAIN\n MAIN --> IDX\n IDX -.按配置.-> MIL\n MAIN -.知识检索按配置.-> QDR\n MAIN -.按配置.-> MODEL\n TEST -.覆盖交易用例.-> CHECK\n\nclassDef newc fill:#e6f6ec,stroke:#17a45f,stroke-width:2px,color:#0b5c3a\nclassDef oldc fill:#f1f3f6,stroke:#9aa3af,stroke-width:1.2px,stroke-dasharray:5 3\nclassDef extc fill:#eaf1fe,stroke:#3574f0\nclassDef warnc fill:#fff4e0,stroke:#e6a23c\nclassDef errc fill:#fdecec,stroke:#e5484d\n\nclass H,G,M,P,BOOT,API,HTTP,STREAM,ERR,CHECK,LIFE,AI,AGENT,ID,MER,CAT,INV,TRADE,PICK,CONV,REPO,REDCONF,GW,MAIN,IDX,TEST oldc\nclass DB,RED,MIL,QDR,MODEL extc\n",
  "seq": "sequenceDiagram\nautonumber\nactor USER as 消费者\nparticipant GUIDE as Guide.js\nparticipant STREAM as AiStreamEndpoint\nparticipant CASE as ShoppingAiCaseImpl\nparticipant CONV as ConversationServiceImpl\nparticipant PORT as AiEnginePort\nparticipant GATE as AiGatewayService\nparticipant PY as main.py\nparticipant SHORT as ConversationTurnCaseImpl\nparticipant CONFIRM as ProposalConfirmationCaseImpl\nparticipant CAT as CatalogServiceImpl\nparticipant INV as InventoryServiceImpl\nparticipant CART as CartServiceImpl\nUSER->>GUIDE: 发起导购会话\nGUIDE->>STREAM: POST /api/v1/ai/chat/stream\nSTREAM->>CASE: chatStream\nCASE->>CONV: beginTurn 获取会话租约\nNote over CASE,PY: Java 收集可读知识范围和候选商品；远程调用期间不持有数据库事务\nCASE->>PORT: IAiEnginePort 召回与查询\nPORT->>GATE: 调用 HTTP 网关\nGATE->>PY: 受控检索 / 流式查询\nPY-->>GATE: 返回建议及知识引用\nGATE-->>PORT: 返回 AI 结果\nPORT-->>CASE: 返回适配结果\nCASE->>CASE: Java 复核候选、报价、库存与知识授权\nCASE->>SHORT: complete 当前轮次\nNote over SHORT: 短事务校验租约并提交消息与提案\nSHORT-->>CASE: 会话与可信提案\nCASE-->>STREAM: 完整结果\nSTREAM-->>GUIDE: completed 事件与进度\nUSER->>GUIDE: 选择商品并确认提案\nGUIDE->>CASE: 经 ShoppingAiController 确认提案\nCASE->>CONFIRM: confirm\nNote over CONFIRM,CART: 单个本地事务内校验本人、商户、报价版本和库存\nCONFIRM->>CAT: 读取并锁定当前报价\nCONFIRM->>INV: 读取当前库存\nCONFIRM->>CART: 幂等确认并加购\nCONFIRM-->>GUIDE: 返回确认状态\nNote over USER,CART: 只加入购物车；下单与模拟付款由用户另行发起\n",
  "flow": "flowchart TB\nsubgraph ROLES[\"面向三类角色的能力\"]\n H[\"Home.js<br/>消费者\"]\n G[\"Guide.js<br/>智能导购\"]\n M[\"MerchantOps.js<br/>商户后台\"]\n P[\"Platform.js<br/>平台后台\"]\nend\nsubgraph BUSINESS[\"七个业务上下文\"]\n ID[\"AccessServiceImpl<br/>Identity · 账号 / 成员 / 权限\"]\n MER[\"MerchantServiceImpl<br/>Merchant · 入驻 / 审核 / 经营\"]\n CAT[\"CatalogServiceImpl<br/>Catalog · 商品 / SKU / 报价\"]\n INV[\"InventoryServiceImpl<br/>Inventory · 补货 / 预占 / 释放\"]\n TRADE[\"OrderServiceImpl<br/>Trading · 购物车 / 订单 / 模拟支付 / 售后\"]\n PICK[\"FulfillmentServiceImpl<br/>Fulfillment · 备货 / 自提 / 核销\"]\n CONV[\"ConversationServiceImpl<br/>ShoppingAI · 对话 / 提案 / 知识\"]\nend\n H --> CAT\n H --> TRADE\n G --> CONV\n M --> MER\n M --> CAT\n M --> INV\n M --> PICK\n P --> MER\n P --> CAT\n P --> TRADE\n ID -.身份与权限.-> MER\n ID -.身份与权限.-> TRADE\n CAT -.商品 / 库存协作.-> INV\n TRADE -.支付后履约.-> PICK\n CONV -.候选复验.-> CAT\n CONV -.库存复验.-> INV\n CONV -.确认后加购.-> TRADE\n\nclassDef newc fill:#e6f6ec,stroke:#17a45f,stroke-width:2px,color:#0b5c3a\nclassDef oldc fill:#f1f3f6,stroke:#9aa3af,stroke-width:1.2px,stroke-dasharray:5 3\nclassDef extc fill:#eaf1fe,stroke:#3574f0\nclassDef warnc fill:#fff4e0,stroke:#e6a23c\nclassDef errc fill:#fdecec,stroke:#e5484d\n\nclass H,G,M,P,ID,MER,CAT,INV,TRADE,PICK,CONV oldc\n",
