  "docs": [
    {
      "id": "home",
      "b": "复用",
      "t": "消费者入口 · 浏览到交易",
      "f": "frontend/src/pages/Home.js",
      "body": "<ul><li>消费者可浏览首页、商户和商品，管理购物车、订单、自提与售后。</li><li>商品价格、库存和经营资格在 Java 后端复验；页面展示不构成交易事实。</li><li>从 <b>Guide.js</b> 进入智能导购，可将可信提案确认加入购物车。</li></ul><p><a href=\"../../../frontend/src/pages/Home.js\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">代表源码</a> · <a href=\"../../../frontend/src/pages/Shop.js\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">商品列表</a> · <a href=\"../../../frontend/src/pages/Cart.js\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">购物车</a> · <a href=\"../../../frontend/src/pages/Orders.js\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">订单</a></p>"
    },
    {
      "id": "guide",
      "b": "复用",
      "t": "Guide.js · 智能导购界面",
      "f": "frontend/src/pages/Guide.js",
      "body": "<ul><li>会话页面接收流式进度与完成结果，展示对话、引用和可确认提案。</li><li>用户确认提案后由服务端复验并加购；不会由模型自动下单或支付。</li><li>会话取消、恢复和失败状态由前后端共同处理。</li></ul><p><a href=\"../../../frontend/src/pages/Guide.js\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">代表源码</a> · <a href=\"../../../frontend/src/services/guide-conversation.js\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">会话传输</a> · <a href=\"../../../campus-shopping-trigger/src/main/java/cn/bugstack/ai/trigger/http/ShoppingAiController.java\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">提案入口</a></p>"
    },
    {
      "id": "merchantui",
      "b": "复用",
      "t": "商户后台 · 商品、履约、知识与权限",
      "f": "frontend/src/pages/MerchantOps.js",
      "body": "<ul><li>商户后台包含工作台、商品和库存管理、订单、自提核销、售后、店员、角色、知识库及门店设置。</li><li>各菜单对应商户权限；界面路由权限只用于展示，实际授权仍由服务端判定。</li><li>商户可管理知识及检索调试，知识可见范围和外发规则须经过 Java 校验。</li></ul><p><a href=\"../../../frontend/src/pages/MerchantOps.js\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">代表源码</a> · <a href=\"../../../frontend/src/services/backoffice-metadata.js\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">导航与权限</a> · <a href=\"../../../frontend/src/pages/Knowledge.js\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">知识管理</a> · <a href=\"../../../frontend/src/pages/RoleManager.js\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">角色权限</a></p>"
    },
    {
      "id": "platformui",
      "b": "复用",
      "t": "平台后台 · 入驻审核与监管",
      "f": "frontend/src/pages/Platform.js",
      "body": "<ul><li>平台后台覆盖商户申请审核、商户和商品监管、订单与争议、分类、知识库以及统计。</li><li>商户开通由 Merchant 与 Identity 协作；监管和售后决定遵循服务端的权限与状态规则。</li><li>这些功能与消费者交易共用业务服务，并不是独立部署的后台微服务。</li></ul><p><a href=\"../../../frontend/src/pages/Platform.js\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">代表源码</a> · <a href=\"../../../frontend/src/services/backoffice-metadata.js\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">后台导航</a> · <a href=\"../../../campus-shopping-trigger/src/main/java/cn/bugstack/ai/trigger/http/MerchantApplicationController.java\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">商户审核入口</a> · <a href=\"../../../campus-shopping-trigger/src/main/java/cn/bugstack/ai/trigger/http/AfterSaleController.java\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">售后争议入口</a></p>"
    },
    {
      "id": "api",
      "b": "复用",
      "t": "API · 接口与 DTO 契约",
      "f": "campus-shopping-api/src/main/java/cn/bugstack/ai/api/IOrderApi.java",
      "body": "<ul><li>campus-shopping-api 定义 HTTP 对应的接口、请求和响应 DTO；图中以 IOrderApi 为代表。</li><li>IShoppingAiApi、ICatalogApi、IAfterSaleApi 等分别描述其他能力。</li><li>修改接口应同步生成契约及字段规则，并核对行为契约。</li></ul><p><a href=\"../../../campus-shopping-api/src/main/java/cn/bugstack/ai/api/IOrderApi.java\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">代表源码</a> · <a href=\"../../../campus-shopping-api/src/main/java/cn/bugstack/ai/api/IShoppingAiApi.java\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">导购接口</a> · <a href=\"../../../docs/api/http-api.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">HTTP 契约</a> · <a href=\"../../../docs/api/behavior-v1.1.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">行为契约</a></p>"
    },
    {
      "id": "http",
      "b": "复用",
      "t": "Trigger · HTTP 及后台任务入口",
      "f": "campus-shopping-trigger/src/main/java/cn/bugstack/ai/trigger/http/OrderController.java",
      "body": "<ul><li>OrderController 是订单入口代表；身份、商户、商品、库存、售后、知识和导购各有自己的 Controller。</li><li>入口处理参数、可信身份和业务异常，跨域事务交给 Case。</li><li>后台还有订单超时与商品向量索引任务；向量同步是否执行取决于配置。</li></ul><p><a href=\"../../../campus-shopping-trigger/src/main/java/cn/bugstack/ai/trigger/http/OrderController.java\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">代表源码</a> · <a href=\"../../../campus-shopping-trigger/src/main/java/cn/bugstack/ai/trigger/http/AuthController.java\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">身份入口</a> · <a href=\"../../../campus-shopping-trigger/src/main/java/cn/bugstack/ai/trigger/http/CatalogController.java\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">商品入口</a> · <a href=\"../../../campus-shopping-trigger/src/main/java/cn/bugstack/ai/trigger/job/OrderExpiryJob.java\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">订单到期任务</a></p>"
    },
    {
      "id": "stream",
      "b": "复用",
      "t": "AiStreamEndpoint · 导购进度事件",
      "f": "campus-shopping-trigger/src/main/java/cn/bugstack/ai/trigger/http/AiStreamEndpoint.java",
      "body": "<ul><li>接收导购流请求，调用 ShoppingAiCaseImpl 的 chatStream，并向界面发送 started、progress、completed 等事件。</li><li>完成事件携带经过服务端校验的完整响应；进度事件并不代表逐字展示模型输出。</li><li>超时、取消和失败有独立状态；流式体验不改变会话与提案的交易边界。</li></ul><p><a href=\"../../../campus-shopping-trigger/src/main/java/cn/bugstack/ai/trigger/http/AiStreamEndpoint.java\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">代表源码</a> · <a href=\"../../../frontend/src/services/guide-conversation.js\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">浏览器接收端</a> · <a href=\"../../../campus-shopping-case/src/main/java/cn/bugstack/ai/cases/shoppingai/impl/ShoppingAiCaseImpl.java\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">导购编排</a></p>"
    },
    {
      "id": "checkout",
      "b": "复用",
      "t": "CheckoutCaseImpl · 交易编排",
      "f": "campus-shopping-case/src/main/java/cn/bugstack/ai/cases/trading/impl/CheckoutCaseImpl.java",
      "body": "<ul><li>下单用例协调账号、商户、商品报价、库存与订单领域，在 MySQL 本地事务中完成关键写入。</li><li>幂等键和请求指纹用于重试；价格、报价版本、商户资格与可售库存需要复验。</li><li>更细的下单、支付、取消和到期过程可打开下单专题地图。</li></ul><p><a href=\"../../../campus-shopping-case/src/main/java/cn/bugstack/ai/cases/trading/impl/CheckoutCaseImpl.java\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">代表源码</a> · <a href=\"../../../docs/code-map/order-payment/campus-shopping-order-payment-20261112.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">下单专题地图</a> · <a href=\"../../../docs/architecture/context-map.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">领域协作约束</a></p>"
    },
    {
      "id": "lifecycle",
      "b": "复用",
      "t": "OrderLifecycleCaseImpl · 支付、取消、到期与履约",
      "f": "campus-shopping-case/src/main/java/cn/bugstack/ai/cases/trading/impl/OrderLifecycleCaseImpl.java",
      "body": "<ul><li>支付是<b>模拟支付</b>；付款相关订单状态和自提任务在本地事务中协调。</li><li>取消、过期、核销和售后需要结合订单状态、库存预占与履约状态进行约束。</li><li>订单到期任务通过此用例触发释放；图中不是消息驱动的真实支付网关。</li></ul><p><a href=\"../../../campus-shopping-case/src/main/java/cn/bugstack/ai/cases/trading/impl/OrderLifecycleCaseImpl.java\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">代表源码</a> · <a href=\"../../../campus-shopping-trigger/src/main/java/cn/bugstack/ai/trigger/job/OrderExpiryJob.java\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">超时扫描</a> · <a href=\"../../../campus-shopping-domain/src/main/java/cn/bugstack/ai/domain/fulfillment/service/impl/FulfillmentServiceImpl.java\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">履约领域</a></p>"
    },
    {
      "id": "aicase",
      "b": "复用",
      "t": "ShoppingAiCaseImpl · 导购编排与事实复核",
      "f": "campus-shopping-case/src/main/java/cn/bugstack/ai/cases/shoppingai/impl/ShoppingAiCaseImpl.java",
      "body": "<ul><li>获取会话租约和可读知识范围，查询候选商品、调用 AI 检索/生成，再由 Java 校验引用、报价和库存。</li><li>远程 AI 长调用不持有数据库事务或行锁；短事务完成消息、提案与当前租约。</li><li>用户确认时由 ProposalConfirmationCaseImpl 同事务复验并幂等加购。</li></ul><p><a href=\"../../../campus-shopping-case/src/main/java/cn/bugstack/ai/cases/shoppingai/impl/ShoppingAiCaseImpl.java\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">代表源码</a> · <a href=\"../../../campus-shopping-case/src/main/java/cn/bugstack/ai/cases/shoppingai/impl/ConversationTurnCaseImpl.java\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">轮次短事务</a> · <a href=\"../../../campus-shopping-case/src/main/java/cn/bugstack/ai/cases/shoppingai/impl/ProposalConfirmationCaseImpl.java\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">确认提案</a> · <a href=\"../../../docs/specs/SDD-REDIS-12.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">租约约束</a></p>"
    },
    {
      "id": "agent",
      "b": "复用",
      "t": "AgentRuntimeCaseImpl · 可选智能体运行时",
      "f": "campus-shopping-case/src/main/java/cn/bugstack/ai/cases/agent/impl/AgentRuntimeCaseImpl.java",
      "body": "<ul><li>Java 侧编排受控的 Agent Runtime 与工具调用；是否启用由配置决定，默认关闭。</li><li>消费者只读工具有明确授权与只读边界；运行时和检索结果不直接拥有商品、库存、订单或支付写权限。</li><li>已有测试或隔离联调不等于全部外部模型、生产环境均通过验收。</li></ul><p><a href=\"../../../campus-shopping-case/src/main/java/cn/bugstack/ai/cases/agent/impl/AgentRuntimeCaseImpl.java\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">代表源码</a> · <a href=\"../../../campus-shopping-case/src/main/java/cn/bugstack/ai/cases/agent/impl/AgentRuntimeEnabledCondition.java\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">启用条件</a> · <a href=\"../../../campus-shopping-infrastructure/src/main/java/cn/bugstack/ai/infrastructure/gateway/AgentRuntimeGateway.java\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">运行时网关</a> · <a href=\"../../../docs/testing/AGENT-V1.1-M3-CONSUMER-READONLY-20261110.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">只读工具范围</a></p>"
    },
    {
      "id": "identity",
      "b": "复用",
      "t": "Identity · 账户、成员与权限",
      "f": "campus-shopping-domain/src/main/java/cn/bugstack/ai/domain/identity/service/impl/AccessServiceImpl.java",
      "body": "<ul><li>维护用户、平台角色、商户成员和角色权限，并为其他用例提供可信身份与授权判断。</li><li>商户营业状态不属于 Identity；商户成员隔离以 merchantId 为边界。</li><li>相关代码包括 AccessServiceImpl、UserAccountServiceImpl 和 RoleServiceImpl。</li></ul><p><a href=\"../../../campus-shopping-domain/src/main/java/cn/bugstack/ai/domain/identity/service/impl/AccessServiceImpl.java\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">代表源码</a> · <a href=\"../../../campus-shopping-domain/src/main/java/cn/bugstack/ai/domain/identity/service/impl/UserAccountServiceImpl.java\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">账号服务</a> · <a href=\"../../../campus-shopping-domain/src/main/java/cn/bugstack/ai/domain/identity/service/impl/RoleServiceImpl.java\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">角色服务</a></p>"
    },
    {
      "id": "merchant",
      "b": "复用",
      "t": "Merchant · 商户入驻与经营资格",
      "f": "campus-shopping-domain/src/main/java/cn/bugstack/ai/domain/merchant/service/impl/MerchantServiceImpl.java",
      "body": "<ul><li>维护商户申请、审核、商户及门店状态，并对交易用例提供经营资格判断。</li><li>审核开通需要 Merchant 与 Identity 协作，跨域状态变更在 Case 中编排。</li><li>店员授权不由 Merchant 直接维护。</li></ul><p><a href=\"../../../campus-shopping-domain/src/main/java/cn/bugstack/ai/domain/merchant/service/impl/MerchantServiceImpl.java\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">代表源码</a> · <a href=\"../../../campus-shopping-domain/src/main/java/cn/bugstack/ai/domain/merchant/service/MerchantApplicationServiceImpl.java\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">入驻申请</a> · <a href=\"../../../campus-shopping-case/src/main/java/cn/bugstack/ai/cases/merchant/impl/MerchantAdmissionCaseImpl.java\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">审核编排</a></p>"
    },
    {
      "id": "catalog",
      "b": "复用",
      "t": "Catalog · 商品、SKU 与可信报价",
      "f": "campus-shopping-domain/src/main/java/cn/bugstack/ai/domain/catalog/service/impl/CatalogServiceImpl.java",
      "body": "<ul><li>负责商品、规格、SKU、报价和上下架，面向消费者与商户提供查询和管理能力。</li><li>Catalog 不拥有库存余额；跨商品与库存的新增 SKU 等操作由 Case 协调。</li><li>AI 召回的候选最终须回到 Java 商品事实校验，不能将向量投影当作价格。</li></ul><p><a href=\"../../../campus-shopping-domain/src/main/java/cn/bugstack/ai/domain/catalog/service/impl/CatalogServiceImpl.java\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">代表源码</a> · <a href=\"../../../campus-shopping-case/src/main/java/cn/bugstack/ai/cases/catalog/impl/CatalogCaseImpl.java\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">商品编排</a> · <a href=\"../../../campus-shopping-trigger/src/main/java/cn/bugstack/ai/trigger/http/CatalogController.java\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">商品入口</a></p>"
    },
    {
      "id": "inventory",
      "b": "复用",
      "t": "Inventory · 库存与预占",
      "f": "campus-shopping-domain/src/main/java/cn/bugstack/ai/domain/inventory/service/impl/InventoryServiceImpl.java",
      "body": "<ul><li>维护每店 SKU 余额、补货流水、订单预占、释放与消耗。</li><li>下单和提案确认读取或锁定当前库存，防止展示缓存或 AI 建议绕过交易复验。</li><li>商品价格属于 Catalog，库存服务不拥有成交价。</li></ul><p><a href=\"../../../campus-shopping-domain/src/main/java/cn/bugstack/ai/domain/inventory/service/impl/InventoryServiceImpl.java\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">代表源码</a> · <a href=\"../../../campus-shopping-trigger/src/main/java/cn/bugstack/ai/trigger/http/InventoryController.java\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">库存入口</a> · <a href=\"../../../campus-shopping-infrastructure/src/main/java/cn/bugstack/ai/infrastructure/adapter/repository/InventoryRepository.java\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">库存仓储</a></p>"
    },
    {
      "id": "trading",
      "b": "复用",
      "t": "Trading · 购物车、订单、模拟支付与售后",
      "f": "campus-shopping-domain/src/main/java/cn/bugstack/ai/domain/trading/service/impl/OrderServiceImpl.java",
      "body": "<ul><li>维护购物车、订单、交易快照、模拟支付记录与售后申请。</li><li>订单和库存跨域写入由 Case 统一本地事务，领域规则仍在各自服务中。</li><li>整单模拟退款、商户处理与平台争议属于交易/售后相关能力。</li></ul><p><a href=\"../../../campus-shopping-domain/src/main/java/cn/bugstack/ai/domain/trading/service/impl/OrderServiceImpl.java\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">代表源码</a> · <a href=\"../../../campus-shopping-domain/src/main/java/cn/bugstack/ai/domain/trading/service/impl/CartServiceImpl.java\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">购物车服务</a> · <a href=\"../../../campus-shopping-domain/src/main/java/cn/bugstack/ai/domain/trading/service/impl/AfterSaleServiceImpl.java\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">售后服务</a> · <a href=\"../../../campus-shopping-trigger/src/main/java/cn/bugstack/ai/trigger/http/AfterSaleController.java\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">售后入口</a></p>"
    },
    {
      "id": "fulfillment",
      "b": "复用",
      "t": "Fulfillment · 备货与自提核销",
      "f": "campus-shopping-domain/src/main/java/cn/bugstack/ai/domain/fulfillment/service/impl/FulfillmentServiceImpl.java",
      "body": "<ul><li>付款后建立自提任务；商户可备货、标记可取，并按权限核销。</li><li>核销凭证、履约状态与订单库存变化需遵循各自领域规则。</li><li>履约不负责真实支付结算或修改商品报价。</li></ul><p><a href=\"../../../campus-shopping-domain/src/main/java/cn/bugstack/ai/domain/fulfillment/service/impl/FulfillmentServiceImpl.java\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">代表源码</a> · <a href=\"../../../campus-shopping-trigger/src/main/java/cn/bugstack/ai/trigger/http/FulfillmentController.java\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">履约入口</a> · <a href=\"../../../campus-shopping-case/src/main/java/cn/bugstack/ai/cases/trading/impl/OrderLifecycleCaseImpl.java\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">跨域事务</a></p>"
    },
    {
      "id": "aidomain",
      "b": "复用",
      "t": "ShoppingAI · 会话、提案与知识",
      "f": "campus-shopping-domain/src/main/java/cn/bugstack/ai/domain/shoppingai/service/impl/ConversationServiceImpl.java",
      "body": "<ul><li>维护导购会话、提案、知识版本与索引任务；知识访问由可读范围和外发规则控制。</li><li>会话使用 turn_token / turn_expires_at 的 600 秒租约；完成结果必须对应当前有效租约。</li><li>知识索引完成须匹配当前 index_attempt；向量索引是投影而非交易事实。</li></ul><p><a href=\"../../../campus-shopping-domain/src/main/java/cn/bugstack/ai/domain/shoppingai/service/impl/ConversationServiceImpl.java\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">代表源码</a> · <a href=\"../../../campus-shopping-domain/src/main/java/cn/bugstack/ai/domain/shoppingai/service/impl/ProposalServiceImpl.java\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">提案服务</a> · <a href=\"../../../campus-shopping-domain/src/main/java/cn/bugstack/ai/domain/shoppingai/service/impl/KnowledgeServiceImpl.java\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">知识服务</a> · <a href=\"../../../campus-shopping-case/src/main/java/cn/bugstack/ai/cases/shoppingai/impl/KnowledgeCaseImpl.java\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">知识用例</a></p>"
    },
    {
      "id": "repo",
      "b": "复用",
      "t": "Infrastructure · MyBatis 与仓储实现",
      "f": "campus-shopping-infrastructure/src/main/java/cn/bugstack/ai/infrastructure/adapter/repository/OrderRepository.java",
      "body": "<ul><li>OrderRepository 代表基础设施层的领域仓储实现；各领域也有各自 Repository、DAO 和映射。</li><li>MySQL 保存订单、库存、商品、身份等事实；查询侧使用受控的只读投影。</li><li>依赖方向是领域声明 Port、基础设施实现 Port；总览箭头表示运行协作，不表示 Domain 直接依赖 Infrastructure。</li></ul><p><a href=\"../../../campus-shopping-infrastructure/src/main/java/cn/bugstack/ai/infrastructure/adapter/repository/OrderRepository.java\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">代表源码</a> · <a href=\"../../../campus-shopping-infrastructure/src/main/java/cn/bugstack/ai/infrastructure/adapter/repository/InventoryRepository.java\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">库存仓储</a> · <a href=\"../../../campus-shopping-infrastructure/src/main/java/cn/bugstack/ai/infrastructure/adapter/repository/KnowledgeRepository.java\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">知识仓储</a> · <a href=\"../../../docs/architecture/context-map.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">领域依赖约束</a></p>"
    },
    {
      "id": "redis",
      "b": "复用",
      "t": "RedisInfrastructureConfig · 共享运行能力",
      "f": "campus-shopping-infrastructure/src/main/java/cn/bugstack/ai/infrastructure/redis/RedisInfrastructureConfig.java",
      "body": "<ul><li>Redis / Redisson 用于共享会话、限流、展示缓存与任务协调。</li><li>多 Java 实例连接共享 MySQL 和 Redis；缓存和准入不是价格、库存或成交的最终事实。</li><li>共享准入成功不等于长任务已经结束；资源许可的释放须匹配实际执行结束。</li></ul><p><a href=\"../../../campus-shopping-infrastructure/src/main/java/cn/bugstack/ai/infrastructure/redis/RedisInfrastructureConfig.java\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">代表源码</a> · <a href=\"../../../campus-shopping-app/src/main/java/cn/bugstack/ai/config/RedisSessionConfig.java\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">共享会话配置</a> · <a href=\"../../../docs/specs/SDD-REDIS-12.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Redis 规格</a> · <a href=\"../../../docs/operations/REDIS-12-runbook.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">运行手册</a></p>"
    },
    {
      "id": "gateway",
      "b": "复用",
      "t": "AiGatewayService · Java / Python 受控边界",
      "f": "campus-shopping-infrastructure/src/main/java/cn/bugstack/ai/infrastructure/gateway/AiGatewayService.java",
      "body": "<ul><li>Java 通过领域 Port 和网关调用 Python 的检索、生成及流式能力。</li><li>网关侧处理网络调用边界；知识访问范围与可对外提供的数据先由 Java 决定。</li><li>Agent Runtime 有独立网关和启用条件，不能把 Python 当作交易写服务。</li></ul><p><a href=\"../../../campus-shopping-infrastructure/src/main/java/cn/bugstack/ai/infrastructure/adapter/port/AiEnginePort.java\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">领域 Port 适配器</a> · <a href=\"../../../campus-shopping-infrastructure/src/main/java/cn/bugstack/ai/infrastructure/gateway/AiGatewayService.java\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">代表源码</a> · <a href=\"../../../campus-shopping-infrastructure/src/main/java/cn/bugstack/ai/infrastructure/gateway/AgentRuntimeGateway.java\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Agent 网关</a> · <a href=\"../../../ai-service/app/main.py\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Python HTTP 入口</a></p>"
    },
    {
      "id": "boot",
      "b": "复用",
      "t": "Application · 应用启动与环境",
      "f": "campus-shopping-app/src/main/java/cn/bugstack/ai/Application.java",
      "body": "<ul><li>campus-shopping-app 负责 Spring Boot 启动、配置装配、Web 资源、会话安全和数据库版本检查。</li><li>项目依赖 Java 17、Node 22.16.0、Python 3.11，以及按运行手册配置的 MySQL / Redis。</li><li>实际启动方式、隔离环境与配置要求以本地开发和运行手册为准；不要把启动成功当成完整业务验收。</li></ul><p><a href=\"../../../campus-shopping-app/src/main/java/cn/bugstack/ai/Application.java\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">代表源码</a> · <a href=\"../../../campus-shopping-app/src/main/java/cn/bugstack/ai/config/SchemaVersionGuard.java\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">数据库版本核验</a> · <a href=\"../../../docs/operations/local-development.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">本地开发</a> · <a href=\"../../../docs/operations/R1-runbook.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">运行手册</a></p>"
    },
    {
      "id": "types",
      "b": "复用",
